msgstr "当模式为 frontend 时为 FRONTEND；当模式为 full 时为 FULL。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:571
msgid "Target secure mode."
msgstr "目标安全模式。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:566
msgid "Switches the secure mode between frontend and full. Full mode also challenges the WordPress admin area. Requires confirm \"FRONTEND\" when mode is frontend and \"FULL\" when mode is full. Supports dry_run."
msgstr "在 frontend 和 full 之间切换安全 模式。Full 模式 还会质询 WordPress 管理区域。当 模式 为 frontend 时要求 确认 “FRONTEND”，当 模式 为 full 时要求 “FULL”。支持 dry_run。"

