msgstr "自由格式的审计批注；不作为设置存储。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:539
msgid "Target protection state."
msgstr "目标保护状态。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:534
msgid "Turns BotBlocker protection on or off through the same path as the Dashboard toggle, including the runtime settings file. Requires confirm \"ENABLE\" when enabling and \"DISABLE\" when disabling. Supports dry_run."
msgstr "通过与仪表盘开关相同的路径开启或关闭 BotBlocker 保护，包括运行时设置文件。启用时要求确认 \"ENABLE\"，停用时要求确认 \"DISABLE\"。支持 dry_run。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:520
msgid "True when the addressed rule exists."
msgstr "当所指向的规则存在时为 true。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:519
