msgstr "生成的过期时间戳；0 表示永不过期。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:487
msgid "Address family of the stored rule."
msgstr "已存储规则的地址族。"

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:484
